id: hac-zwvk
title: Tag publication runner omits mandatory release verification tools
description: "The v2026.7.23 tag-driven Release workflow reaches bun run release:verify on a clean runner without provisioning ripgrep or Trivy, so the mandatory gate exits 127 before changelog, package smoke, publication, or release creation."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags[6]: github-actions,production-follow-up,publish,release,security,trivy
created_at: "2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-24T21:26:06.502Z"
deadline: "2026-07-25T21:02:44.626Z"
assignee: codex-root
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "Tag-driven publish provisions ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy before release:verify; Workflow YAML, ShellCheck, local release verifier, and a hosted non-publishing rehearsal prove the complete clean-runner contract; Open GitHub blocker 68 is closed only after successful exact-head hosted evidence"
definition_of_ready: "Failed Release run 29982873926 and workflow source identify missing binaries, not a product test failure"
goal: lossless-automatic-releases
objective: publication-runner-verifier-parity
value: Restore reliable provenance publication without weakening mandatory gates.
impact: Prevents tagged releases from being stranded after the release commit and tag are created.
outcome: Preparation and publication runners install the same verifier prerequisites.
why_now: "v2026.7.23 exists but its tag-driven release failed before publication, leaving GitHub issue 68 open."
parent: hac-r17v
reviewer: unbraind
risk: high
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-compact-registry
release: 2026.7.24
reporter: codex-root
severity: high
environment: GitHub Actions Release workflow on clean ubuntu-latest runner
repro_steps: Run publish.yml for v2026.7.23; Verify release quality gates reaches scripts/release/verify-release.sh and exits 127 when rg and trivy are invoked.
expected_result: The tag-driven runner provisions every mandatory verifier binary and proceeds to changelog/package/publication gates.
actual_result: "All 1209 tests and 100 percent coverage pass, then release:verify fails because rg and trivy are not installed."
affected_version: 2026.7.23
component: release-automation
regression: false
customer_impact: The package and GitHub release are not published even though the version commit and tag exist.
