comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z",codex-root,"This is not a duplicate of hac-l25p: that issue repaired pm-changelog and verifier provisioning in auto-release.yml; this production failure is in the separate tag-driven publish.yml runner."
  "2026-07-24T21:16:56.796Z",codex-root,"publish.yml now provisions ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy before release:verify. Manual dispatch defaults to dry_run=true and statically guards all three irreversible publication/release steps; focused workflow contract and YAML parsing pass."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z",codex-root,Do not rerun publication until the workflow fix is merged; local and PR verification must remain non-publishing.
  "2026-07-24T21:16:58.104Z",codex-root,Hosted proof will use workflow_dispatch against an existing tag with dry_run=true after the branch is pushed; this exercises the independent runner without npm publication or GitHub release creation.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z",codex-root,A downstream tag workflow has an independent clean-runner environment; provisioning tools in the parent auto-release job does not carry into publish.yml.
