body: "## Production evidence\\n\\nThe exact tagged release run completed all tests and 100 percent coverage, then failed in security step 8 because rg and trivy were absent. The auto-release preparation workflow already provisions ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy; publish.yml must share that prerequisite contract."
